{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["Besides the first famine that was in the days of Avraham — as written: ויהי רעב בארץ וירד אברהם מצרימה. This verse was unnecessary except to inform you that just as Avraham his father went because of the famine to Egypt, so too Yitzhak was about to go down to Egypt by way of the land of the Philistines — a short route, as written: ולא נחם אלהים דרך ארץ פלשתים כי קרוב הוא. And therefore the Holy One, blessed be He, said to him: Do not go down to Egypt — because the Holy One, blessed be He, knew that he was about to go down to Egypt."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:45:15.037050849Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}